体吃下来味道挺好。店里的面口感比较地道，分量给得很足，吃完能吃得很饱。店员服务态度很不错，待人客气，响应也及时。整体吃下来体验挺好。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3363744343","user":"安**","time":"7月25日","star":4.5,"text":"这家陕西风味面馆！进店环境干净敞亮，明厨亮灶看得见，吃得很放心！\n「西安干拌Biangbiang面」面条宽厚劲道，口感十足，牛肉切片厚实，分量实在，配菜新鲜入味，红油香而不燥。地道的西北口味，一碗下去饱腹感满满。服务员很热情周到，出餐很快！","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/s-r3geyr8CRx2_MXdO6HbUIsKnLrSEQZe60lyypKeI_oEswSqAaRQBHReVGBiyvIElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/xcVHyJvjGocVCKS8MfqEa1I2gNYOqLqhU84PpzWNvGRfdXyEWUi1ET5t8Ap_qt5dElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Uwp1LiMN68yU9lbC2f0GzQnuS227D2OGQUXhwyqiAxDqJuuM87DnC0uIVx2EpQU8Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3362071630","user":"匿**","time":"7月24日","star":5,"text":"很幸运抽中了霸王餐，套餐是油泼臊子biangbiang面加冰峰。我选择了打包，包装严实，没有洒漏。面条宽厚筋道，臊子分量足，油泼辣子香而不呛，拌匀后很入味，整体咸香开胃。搭配冰峰刚刚好，解辣又爽口。套餐分量挺足，味道也不错，值得尝试！","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/dVin323_HnEFi7pgtj0sg62KUViNY_OI9TufbS__uWPmDmJvGl99sJdnOrNgtYqaElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/ks1ZuFli_McxLLdYVV5Q2r1cwUHVcoWtYXOP9FIfOctCj6qJoTlpzz9jHCbjYamCElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/crUOzMox_pC5kUt4B27sWRLnT9-jkkd-yogrcSDrPE0yJxJ0m_URV-F5gUBIMThWElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3361916189","user":"匿**","time":"7月24日","star":4,"text":"很幸运抽到了霸王餐，刚好在公司附近，就中午去吃了。位置还挺好找的，在招商银行后面点。 个人很少吃面食，这次的面，我光盘了，味道不错的。就是里面的肉皮肥肉稍微多了些。不算影响味道。店员服务态度不错，因为是12点半之后去吃的，所以人会少一些。据说肉夹馍味道也可以，下次会去试试。下次会去吃一下肉夹馍。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/_VWr5w1JriJWPIi_HoNuKWex2-V2cQzldmgDFeXK2zHmw80REYeGyCBynvAdByOTElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/yds3y17BGeoAcAWR7LTU0wo4ObyWDt8eIyMGh6o1fqVkWcIy23J9xD2w_tilS2wHElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/u1x2XdqDtdvfNkVI4uRvp1c2WOBZQAySXbec76mqSaQLX4X4Ge9OhqFMYyuYgN8PElc2-txFTxviA